   "html": "<div layer-name=\"Page\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:28px;padding:32px;flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;min-height:0\">\n  <div layer-name=\"Artboard Header\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--spacing-xs)\">\n    <div layer-name=\"Artboard Title\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:22px;font-weight:var(--font-weight-semibold);line-height:28px;color:var(--color-canvas-label-title);white-space:nowrap\">Read a spot</div>\n    <div layer-name=\"Job\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:var(--text-body);font-weight:var(--font-weight-regular);line-height:var(--leading-body);color:var(--color-canvas-label-title);max-width:900px\">The spot page explains a score from the top down: the lead card, the windows, then the reasons. When a forecast is missing, failed, or the sun never sets, the page says so instead of guessing.</div>\n  </div>\n  <div layer-name=\"Journey\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0\">\n    <div layer-name=\"Main Journey\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;flex-direction:row;align-items:flex-start\">\n      <div layer-name=\"Step 1 / Spot page · Sample\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;padding:12px;flex-shrink:0;width:344px;height:316px;background:var(--color-canvas-specimen-background);border-radius:var(--radius-card);border:1px solid var(--color-canvas-specimen-border)\">\n        <div layer-name=\"Thumb Frame\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;flex-direction:row;flex-shrink:0;border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--color-canvas-specimen-border);width:322px;height:207px\">\n          <img layer-name=\"Thumb / Spot page · Sample\" data-asset=\"thumbs/S-spot-sample.png\" src=\"paper-asset:///path/to/Iter/Design/paper/assets/thumbs/S-spot-sample.png\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:block;flex-shrink:0;width:320px;height:205px;object-fit:cover\"/>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
